<p>Each turn, those caught in your gloom must save against your Mindpower, or have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 9%, 10%, 12%, 13%</acronym> chance to be crippled by fear for 3 turns, reducing damage they inflict by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">-12%, -17%, -21%, -24%, -26%.</acronym> The first time you melee strike a foe after they have been weakened will give you 2 hate.</p><p>The chance increases with your mind speed.</p><p>Each point in Gloom talents increases your Mindpower (current total: <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 4, 7, 9, 12</acronym>).</p>